## Service layer (`service/` + `service/impl/`)

- Always create `{Feature}Service` interface in `service/` with Javadoc on every method
- Always create `{Feature}ServiceImpl` in `service/impl/` annotated with `@Service`
- Use `@RequiredArgsConstructor` for constructor injection — never `@Autowired`
- Throw typed `AppException` subclasses — never throw bare `RuntimeException`
- Never import `HttpStatus` or `ResponseEntity` in service layer
- Use `Optional.orElseThrow(() -> new ResourceNotFoundException(...))` for not-found
- Annotate write methods with `@Transactional` on the implementation (not the interface)
- `@Transactional` on public methods only — private methods are silently ignored by Spring AOP
- Never log at ERROR level in service layer — let `GlobalExceptionHandler` log at the boundary
- Use `@PreAuthorize` at service layer for method-level security — not just controller
- Never call `MDC.put()` directly in service methods — MDC is set in filters

```java
// Correct service interface
public interface OrderService {

  /**
   * Finds an order by its ID.
   *
   * @param id the order ID
   * @return the order as a response DTO
   * @throws ResourceNotFoundException if no order exists with the given ID
   */
  OrderResponse findById(Long id);

  /**
   * Creates a new order.
   *
   * @param request the order creation payload
   * @return the created order as a response DTO
   * @throws ConflictException if an order with the same reference already exists
   */
  OrderResponse create(OrderRequest request);

  /**
   * Deletes an order by its ID.
   *
   * @param id the order ID
   * @throws ResourceNotFoundException if no order exists with the given ID
   */
  void delete(Long id);
}

// Correct service implementation
@Service
@RequiredArgsConstructor
@Slf4j
public class OrderServiceImpl implements OrderService {

  private final OrderRepository orderRepository;
  private final OrderMapper     orderMapper;

  @Override
  public OrderResponse findById(Long id) {
    return orderRepository.findById(id)
        .map(orderMapper::toResponse)
        .orElseThrow(() -> new ResourceNotFoundException("Order not found: " + id));
  }

  @Override
  @Transactional
  public OrderResponse create(OrderRequest request) {
    log.info("Creating order: customerId={}", request.customerId());
    Order saved = orderRepository.save(orderMapper.toEntity(request));
    log.info("Order created: orderId={}", saved.getId());
    return orderMapper.toResponse(saved);
  }

  @Override
  @Transactional
  public void delete(Long id) {
    Order order = orderRepository.findById(id)
        .orElseThrow(() -> new ResourceNotFoundException("Order not found: " + id));
    orderRepository.delete(order);
    log.info("Order deleted: orderId={}", id);
  }
}
```

