## Exception hierarchy (use these — never bare RuntimeException)

```
AppException
├── ResourceNotFoundException   → 404  throw when entity not found
├── ValidationException         → 400  throw for business rule violations
├── ConflictException           → 409  throw for duplicate / state conflicts
├── ForbiddenException          → 403  throw for ownership / permission checks
├── UnauthorizedException       → 401  throw for missing / invalid auth
├── RateLimitedException        → 429  throw when rate limit exceeded
└── ExternalServiceException    → 502  throw when downstream call fails
```

